{
 "5918": {
  "en": [
   "We seek playmates—",
   "Before dawn breaks we wake those who sleep all night long.",
   "We call with the voice of birds, we dance beneath the bakul tree,",
   "We know the spell that beguiles the mind, we lay our snares upon the wind.",
   "Death we do not heed at all,",
   "Slipping the noose of Time, we snatch away its plundered treasure.",
   "We are the thieves of your heart, we will never let you go—",
   "Whatever darkness you walk toward, there too our lamp burns."
