 "5919": {
  "en": [
   "As our play is, so is our work—don't you know, brother?",
   "That is why we never fear work.",
   "Our fighting is play, our living and dying is play,",
   "Nothing exists anywhere but play.",
   "In play the flowers have bloomed, in play the fruit ripens,",
   "The waves of play roll over water and land.",
   "When the fire of play catches in terror's dreadful crimson glow,",
   "All that is broken burns down to ash."
  ],
