 "5920": {
  "en": [
   "We set our hands to every task, to every task.",
   "There is no bar, no bond—none at all.",
   "We look, we seek, we fathom; we only break, we build, we struggle,",
   "We roam through every land in every guise.",
   "Whether we can or cannot, whether we win or lose—",
   "If we simply let go of the helm, we die of that very shame.",
   "By the strength of our own hands we raise up what we create,",
   "With our hearts we build a home, and dwell within it."
