 "5921": {
  "en": [
   "Hard iron lay senseless in hard sleep—and I have broken its slumber.",
   "It lay hidden in the dark of a hundred thousand ages—oh, I have wakened it.",
   "It has grown tame under my hand; whatever I bid it say, it says—",
   "Today I have driven off its silence of long days.",
   "It was motionless; now stirred to motion it races out to conquer the world—",
   "Fearless today, with both my hands I have gripped its reins."
