 "5922": {
  "en": [
   "We till the soil in joy.",
   "From field to field the day goes by, morning to evening.",
   "The sun comes up, the rain comes down, leaves stir in the bamboo grove,",
   "The wind rises brimful with the scent of tilled earth.",
   "The script of green life's song shows itself in line after line,",
   "What young poet revels in its dance-swaying rhythm!",
   "A thrill runs through the ears of rice—all the earth breaks out laughing",
   "In Aghran's golden sunshine, beneath the full moon."
  ],
