 "5923": {
  "en": [
   "You flow laughing on your way, like the murmuring current of a river.",
   "We stand on the bank and gaze, while countless longings smoulder and die in our hearts.",
   "You whisper happily among yourselves, glints of mirth brimming in your eyes and faces,",
   "Lotus feet fall upon the earth, golden anklets chiming their tinkling music.",
   "",
   "Limb to limb you bind in ties of play, arm entwined with arm like graceful vines.",
   "Laughter rings out rich with hinted meaning, secret words flow from eye to eye.",
   "With downcast eyes you string flowers alone, mirror in hand you bind your hair with care.",
   "In your secret heart you play by yourself—",
   "What thoughts do you think, how do the hours pass?",
   "",
   "We come rushing on like a vast witless storm, driven by our own passion,",
   "Shrouding the endless sky in immense darkness, longing to burst our own heaped hearts.",
   "You glance like lightning, laughing as you look; cleaving the dark, you pierce the heart—",
   "Tracing a line of fire across the sky, on startled feet you slip away and elude us.",
   "",
   "Carelessly Fate has fashioned our bodies, has not filled our eyes and lips with speech—",
   "We know no enchanting honeyed spell; how shall we reveal ourselves?",
   "Where are you, and where are we—",
   "Shall we never come close at some auspicious hour—",
   "You will flow laughing on your way, and we will stand here just like this."
  ],
