   "Turning back again and again, brother, toward whom do you gaze?",
   "New folk have come to play new games on the stage of the world.",
   "Move away from here, or they will pelt you with clods.",
   "Set down the burden of your heart, go straight on to another land—",
   "There you will build your nest anew,",
   "And play new games in that place."
