 "5930": {
  "en": [
   "The clouds drift on and on, calling to the moon, 'Come, come.'",
   "Half in sleep the moon murmurs, 'Where? Where?'",
   "Who knows where they are going, who knows what may be there,",
   "In the middle of the sky the moon looks all around.",
   "Far away, so very far away, perhaps in some celestial city",
   "The stars sit in a ring and play their flutes.",
   "And so the maidens, laughing and laughing, go floating across the sky,",
   "And slip away in secret, stealing the moon's smile."
