 "5931": {
  "en": [
   "(I) have spread out across that Shravan sky",
   "my eyes brimming wet with tears, from cloud to cloud.",
   "(My pain goes spreading through the rustle, the rustle of the bamboo grove.)",
   "Crossing the horizon of separation, all night long",
   "they keep watch unblinking, from cloud to cloud.",
   "(On the far shore of separation my restless eyes are searching",
   "for the image of union—searching.)",
   "The one who has gone beyond all seeing—",
   "toward her still I gaze.",
   "(She left tears in my eyes that pass beyond the eyes' own bounds.)",
   "In dream her streaming hair goes flying",
   "on the rushing east wind, from cloud to cloud.",
   "(I feel the touch of her hair",
   "on the rushing east wind, from cloud to cloud.)",
   "In the dark tamal grove,",
   "on the path she took in the twilight of parting,",
   "pain lies entwined in its grass—",
   "(The ache of her unspoken words rings on—",
   "rings on along the path, along her path.)",
   "it trembles in every breath—",
   "that turning back to look, again and again, again and again,",
   "still clings to the shadows, from cloud to cloud."
  ],
